---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — The Money Margin"
  description="Terms of Service and Website Usage Agreement for The Money Margin."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 sm:py-12">
    <div class="mb-8 font-sans">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#5C6B7A] mb-4">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-[#E67E22] transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-[#E67E22] font-bold">Terms of Service</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B3C] font-sans tracking-tight">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-sans font-semibold text-[#5C6B7A] mt-2">
        Last Updated: November 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="font-serif text-[#1A2B3C] text-base sm:text-lg leading-[1.8] space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          1. Agreement to Terms
        </h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using <strong>The Money Margin</strong> (<a href="https://moneymarginsecret.com" class="text-[#E67E22] hover:underline">moneymarginsecret.com</a>), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any portion of these terms, please discontinue using the website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          2. Intellectual Property Rights
        </h2>
        <p>
          All original articles, case studies, calculation tables, and graphic elements published on this website are the copyrighted property of Daniel Reyes and The Money Margin, unless explicitly stated otherwise. You may cite short excerpts with proper attribution and a direct link back to the original article, but full syndication or unauthorized reprinting is strictly prohibited.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          3. Limitation of Liability
        </h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall The Money Margin or its author be held liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages resulting from the use or inability to use the information, templates, scripts, or guidance provided on this website. Readers assume full responsibility for any financial decisions and outcomes.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold font-sans text-[#1A2B3C] mb-3 pb-2 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
          4. Governing Law & Contact
        </h2>
        <p>
          These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, United States. For any inquiries, reach out to <a href="mailto:wrwanshenchen@gmail.com" class="text-[#E67E22] font-semibold hover:underline font-mono">wrwanshenchen@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
